cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rateguard in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rateguard: A Thread-Safe Rate Limiter for LLM API Calls in Python"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/rateguard"
url: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/rateguard"
abstract: >
  rateguard is a pure-Python, zero-dependency library that provides
  thread-safe token-bucket and sliding-window rate limiters for
  applications that call large language model (LLM) APIs.
keywords:
  - rate limiting
  - LLM
  - API throttling
  - token bucket
  - sliding window
  - Python
authors:
